        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2563] In case of EIM, the SECC shall complete the authorization at the SECC and provide appropriate response to the EVCC via AuthorizationRes. Refer to 8.6 and its subclauses for details of the response codes.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                167,
